@AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5294
@ClaimId = CLM-REMPLACER

### SQL Server health
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/database
Accept: application/json

### FastAPI health through .NET
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/ai
Accept: application/json

### Claims - first page
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Claims - status filter
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims?status=Ouvert&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Claims - type filter
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims?type=Accident&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Claims - identifier search
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims?search=CLM-&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Claim details
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims/{{ClaimId}}
Accept: application/json

### Consolidated claim context
GET {{AstreeClaims_Api_HostAddress}}/api/claims/{{ClaimId}}/context
Accept: application/json
